      "id": "kb-3",
      "title": "Incident Response Runbook",
      "type": "runbook",
      "category": "Operations",
      "tags": ["incidents", "operations", "troubleshooting"],
      "description": "Step-by-step procedures for handling production incidents",
      "markdownContent": "# Incident Response Runbook\n\n## Severity Levels\n\n### SEV-1: Critical\n- Production down or severely impacted\n- Response time: 15 minutes\n- Escalation: Immediate\n\n### SEV-2: High\n- Major feature unavailable\n- Response time: 1 hour\n- Escalation: Within 2 hours\n\n### SEV-3: Medium\n- Minor feature impacted\n- Response time: 4 hours\n- Escalation: Within 8 hours\n\n## Response Steps\n\n1. **Acknowledge**\n   - Acknowledge incident in monitoring system\n   - Join incident bridge\n   - Assign incident commander\n\n2. **Assess**\n   - Gather information\n   - Determine severity\n   - Identify affected systems\n\n3. **Mitigate**\n   - Implement immediate fixes\n   - Restore service if possible\n   - Communicate status\n\n4. **Resolve**\n   - Apply permanent fix\n   - Verify resolution\n   - Close incident\n\n5. **Post-Mortem**\n   - Document timeline\n   - Identify root cause\n   - Create action items",
      "author": "Emily Watson",
      "lastUpdated": "2024-03-18T11:00:00Z",
      "viewCount": 203,
      "region": "Global"
    },
